## 2. The join and the splitting map

The join $\mathrm{Oct}(m)\star\mathrm{Oct}(n)$ has all axes of both factors, with **no cross-constraints**. The key construction routes the axes of $\mathrm{Oct}(m+n+1)$ into the two factors:

