## 5. Takeaway

To combine two symmetric problems, **add their difficulty and then add one**. That surplus $+1$ is the extra dimension the join manufactures — the same shift in $S^m\star S^n\cong S^{m+n+1}$, in the dimension law, and in the co-index law.
